---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const title = 'Privacy Policy | slipfallcalculator.com';
const description = 'Privacy policy for slipfallcalculator.com — how we collect, use, and protect information.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description}>
  <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
  <p><strong>Effective date:</strong> January 1, 2026<br />
  <strong>Last updated:</strong> May 2026</p>

  <p>slipfallcalculator.com is operated by The Click Lab (&ldquo;we,&rdquo; &ldquo;us,&rdquo; or &ldquo;our&rdquo;). This Privacy Policy explains what information is collected when you visit the site, how it is used, and your choices about that use. We are committed to transparency about our data practices.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect directly</h2>
  <p>We do not collect personally identifiable information directly from visitors. The calculator inputs you enter (medical bills, lost wages, injury severity) are processed entirely in your browser using JavaScript. That data is never transmitted to our servers or stored anywhere outside your device.</p>
  <p>If you contact us by email, we receive your email address and the content of your message. We use this information only to respond to your inquiry. We do not add you to any mailing list or share your contact information with third parties.</p>

  <h2>Information collected by third-party services</h2>
  <p>We use third-party services that collect usage data independently under their own privacy policies.</p>

  <h3>Google AdSense</h3>
  <p>We display advertising through Google AdSense (pub-6434377544325972). AdSense uses cookies and similar tracking technologies to serve ads based on prior visits to this site and other sites on the web. Google may use data about your visits to personalize the ads you see. You can review Google&rsquo;s advertising data practices and opt out of personalized advertising at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Ad Settings</a>. Google&rsquo;s full privacy policy is at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</p>

  <h3>Google Analytics</h3>
  <p>We use Google Analytics 4 to understand aggregate traffic patterns &mdash; which pages are visited, how long visitors spend on the site, and where traffic originates. Google Analytics collects data through cookies and device identifiers. This data is aggregated and does not identify individual visitors. We use it solely to improve site content. You can opt out of Google Analytics tracking using the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

  <h2>Cookies</h2>
  <p>We do not set first-party cookies. Google AdSense and Google Analytics set third-party cookies on your device when you visit the site. These cookies enable ad personalization and analytics tracking as described above. Most browsers allow you to block or delete cookies through browser settings. Note that blocking cookies may affect ad functionality but will not affect your ability to use the calculator or read guides.</p>
  <p>Under GDPR and similar regulations, non-essential cookies (including advertising and analytics cookies) require consent in certain jurisdictions. If you are in the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom, or another jurisdiction with cookie consent requirements, you should manage your preferences through your browser or the opt-out links above.</p>

  <h2>California residents (CCPA)</h2>
  <p>If you are a California resident, the California Consumer Privacy Act gives you rights regarding your personal information. As noted above, we do not directly collect personal information from visitors. To the extent Google AdSense or Google Analytics involve the &ldquo;sale&rdquo; of personal information as defined by CCPA, you may opt out of that activity through Google&rsquo;s ad settings. For requests related to personal information we may hold (e.g., from email correspondence), contact us at <a href="mailto:hey@theclicklab.agency">hey@theclicklab.agency</a>.</p>

  <h2>Children&rsquo;s privacy</h2>
  <p>This site is not directed to children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided personal information through this site, contact us and we will delete it promptly.</p>

  <h2>Data security</h2>
  <p>We do not store personal data on our servers and do not transmit calculator inputs or visitor data. Third-party services (Google AdSense, Google Analytics) maintain their own security practices described in their respective privacy policies.</p>

  <h2>Links to other sites</h2>
  <p>This site contains links to external websites, including legal resources, bar association directories, and government sites. Once you leave slipfallcalculator.com, this privacy policy no longer applies. We encourage you to review the privacy policy of any external site you visit.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this privacy policy as our practices or applicable law changes. The &ldquo;Last updated&rdquo; date at the top of this page reflects the most recent revision. Continued use of the site after a policy update constitutes acceptance of the revised terms.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this privacy policy or your data? Email <a href="mailto:hey@theclicklab.agency">hey@theclicklab.agency</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>
